<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 180.39 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 180.39 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 180.39 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 242.84 million on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
